      "role": "Co-founder of StalCrew"
    },
    {
      "id": "4",
      "content": "The team at OB Studio doesn't just design—they strategize. They helped us rethink our entire user experience and the results speak for themselves. Our user engagement increased by 40% after the redesign.",
